Send native /fast controls without a streaming latch or pending bubble.

Bypass the turn queue, preserve running responses on success and failure,
and surface command delivery errors. Applies after 0009-composer-fast-mode.patch.
Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d).
